entityDescription:
Freelance technical translator from English into French, I propose translation and revision services for the various documents, reports, media, training, publications, communications, website contents, studies, analyses, etc., on which your organisation and partners rely to carry out their activities.

As a specialist in technical content translation and revision, and experienced linguist working regularly for European organisations like the European Parliament and think tanks on EU-related topics such as politics, science, health, security, internal market and migration among others, I propose you my support for your translations into French.
Also passionate about space, exploration and discoveries, I would be delighted to work on projects related to ESA's activities.

By entrusting your translation needs to me, you can expect not only accurate and precise translations, but also a commitment to conveying your message with fluency and cultural nuance, ensuring maximum impact and resonance with your target audience. I will ensure a comprehensive management of the process, namely:

- document preparation, if necessary (PDF extraction to an editable format, correction of the extraction for exploitation purposes);
- translation, proofreading in a CAT tool for performance;
- revision by a third party specialised translator for optimal quality, if requested (optional, if not covered by your services);
- final layout in a variety of file formats;
- creation of glossaries (optional);
- creation of translation memories for consistency with future projects;
- delivery of the document ready for use.

I provide tailored quotations before carrying out the service under the agreed terms.
Do not hesitate to contact me for any further information or project/quotation request.
